{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "6923b897a62a1148f7773e61fe97385e0c8a5cc7fb0881c681950ec5c2db45cf", "ja": "荒野の風、心を紡いで", "zh": "荒野之风，织就心弦", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0ef31f99a97a59754cc0b21d7d52d4f1b3d052414ce4c1d720647ae5d2accdcb", "ja": "カメラが回り、エミリーが歌い始めた。その\n歌声に聞き惚れる一同とプロデューサー。今\n日のエミリーはちゃんと役に見えたと言う美\n希に、エミリーは喜ぶ。エミリーが作ったお\n菓子を食べて、心を通わせるアイドル達。", "zh": "镜头转动起来，艾米莉开始唱歌。众人和制作人都听得入了迷。美希说，今天的艾米莉总算像是演好角色了，艾米莉听后很高兴。偶像们吃着艾米莉做的点心，彼此心意相通。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cc849cb42dcdebbd421d2beb52a7fa7ef1bf99cc568c53f50d89afece4d6ab04", "ja": "（あれから撮影は順調に進んでいる。\n残されたシーンは、もういくつもない……）", "zh": "（从那以后拍摄一直很顺利。还剩下的场景已经不多了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e8a35e3b9523187fd841e5d757fcbf865405fb1bf53f8d862f525f23eae043fe", "ja": "（この前の撮影では、歌にダメ出しをされた。\n今日はそのリベンジだ……頑張れよ、エミリー！）", "zh": "（之前拍摄时，歌唱被指出了问题。今天要一雪前耻……加油啊，艾米莉！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "f0a965cce4361fb93dffb374b67cdeab6f1ac3744ee0ea734ab8ab0acfdb5248", "ja": "みなさんが、教えてくださったように。\n私ではなく……アマリリスが歌う歌を……。", "zh": "就像大家教我的那样。\n不再由我……而是让金盏花来歌唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "e5cb784e1f3baa20a700539bc8dd14369e9b9e8ac230b9d814e522e9be344b7d", "ja": "あっ！\nエミリーちゃんの歌、歌い方が変わった……？", "zh": "啊！\n艾米莉的歌声，唱法变了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "ff57ac24883f16ac570b5bb0f1598f3d440b969ab0d57c368cf94edd94f119ce", "ja": "うん。なんだか、本当にアマリリスがいるみたいだ……\n美希！　エミリーの歌、どう思う？", "zh": "嗯。不知怎么的，感觉真的像有朱顶红在一样……\n美希！你觉得艾米莉的歌怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "dafb8f2bcaaf0043c3ce3adb09be0f0f11ad9e670896860ed427afaf7afd3b01", "ja": "この前より、ずーっといいカンジなの。\n{$P$}、エミリーに特訓してあげた？", "zh": "比之前感觉好多了呢。\n{$P$}先生，你给艾米莉特训了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ec4bcb10a9c5712ec92ac2778eafce79ce95a43fb152670a62ca9010b542cbce", "ja": "いや、俺じゃないよ。美希と千早のアドバイスと……\nあとは、エミリーの努力の結果かな。", "zh": "不，不是我哦。是美希和千早的建议……\n还有艾米莉自己努力的成果吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "418da1e52023ada7072ed18c83b97df4012eba1e5a45b04d93862ecdb23a28ae", "ja": "でもミキ、結局何もしてないよ？\nアドバイスしてくれたのは、千早さんじゃない？", "zh": "可是美希最后什么都没做吧？\n给出建议的不是千早吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "d53f7d16034fa0fa2e5374da2cdec2e1b83148fedeec99a2e9d5470eb843109a", "ja": "私はエミリーとすこし話をして、CDを貸しただけよ。\nだから、本人が頑張ったんだと思う。", "zh": "我只是和艾米莉稍微聊了几句，借给她一张CD而已。\n所以，我觉得是她自己努力的结果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "14416f74e392abed4366c2b643fd136331d519eebd6c7aed71311acb22f9561a", "ja": "ふーん、そうなんだ。\nあはっ、エミリーってすごいんだね！", "zh": "哦——原来是这样啊。\n啊哈，艾米莉真厉害呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c1999c9c7c21190cdbf8352455a020dd478ff27484d1308c17eb6f82fe643e67", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。美希もほめてあげるといいよ。\nきっと喜ぶからな！", "zh": "啊，是啊。也夸夸美希吧。\n她一定会很高兴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6a416767d5ded1ea3fac2edfe8492263ac2a88c58cb6df9da12e48df31662a32", "ja": "（エミリー……アマリリスの歌は、荒野を響いていく\n風のようにも聞こえた。遠く、彼方へと……）", "zh": "（艾米莉……苋菜花的歌声，听起来仿佛是回荡在荒野上的风。\n向着遥远的彼方……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "37a3a635a67fb03ba853bd3b1c60782fdda8272b6416a48004846ca532c2a8ed", "ja": "（いつしかみんな、ただじっと聞き入っている。\n……これならきっと、大丈夫だろう）", "zh": "（不知不觉间，大家都只是静静地听着。\n……这样一来，应该就没问题了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "3fc42a20243e304027025d656535903d1db9d9f82600c0def244147ad8638662", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、お疲れさまでした。\nあの、い、いかがでしたか……？", "zh": "制作人，辛苦了。\n那个，您、您觉得怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f101e3039817fe3363b27a6fb10fb4e5f7d15005968cdb721f91058581e1328b", "ja": "お疲れさま、エミリー。その事なら、俺じゃなくて\nみんなに聞いた方がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "辛苦了，艾米莉。那件事的话，比起问我，不如去问问大家吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "68b50fb37f9f91d9b0ce7f17c2f34277a141f630450c0ea5027ed92887df0fde", "ja": "ええっ！？　み、みなさんにですか？\nでも、それは……。", "zh": "诶诶！？要、要问大家吗？\n可是，那件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "2e78f5a07e15e0d8a2a8b03805298781cb268a65390cc1a5635d81729b7090a5", "ja": "エミリー、お疲れさまなの。\n今の歌、けっこういい感じだったね。", "zh": "艾米莉，辛苦啦。\n刚才那首歌，感觉还挺不错的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "712ab25685e6d50570461dfed1a3f046c757bc32d84fb917ac87e072c0850d2b", "ja": "あっ……ほ、本当ですか、美希さん！\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "啊……真、真的吗，美希小姐！谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "814c8fd26f4c948cdecc2f88956a9a9a1b827f84117eea29dbd9afc02362d00c", "ja": "うん。今日のエミリーは、ちゃんと\nアマリリスに見えたの。", "zh": "嗯。今天的艾米莉，看起来确实像\n朱顶红呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "760197199f5684b15e82ec9b0b7d4e8ef22a4dea75aa2c42aa4e2ea41fa58e22", "ja": "今日の歌い方は、ピッタリだったよ。\nエミリー、がんばったんだね。", "zh": "今天的唱法特别合适哦。\n艾米莉，你很努力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "3ae2aa458ce39ba819cc2cd1f522d51e5985f8adb068274b60063db7c55500db", "ja": "いえ……美希さんの、ご指南のおかげです！\nありがとうございました！", "zh": "哪里……这都是多亏了美希小姐的指点！\n非常感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "84c3a9acd293d704bc8adbb646688e09b975c461130d1267093293627cefacd2", "ja": "Wow！　やりました、仕掛け人さまっ！\n私、ちゃんと歌えていたみたいです！", "zh": "Wow！太好了，策划人大人！\n我好像，好好地唱出来了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "1683aa71341f755e8c206bed52af899bae2aa7e2b87f9cff8df6987c4b1dafd0", "ja": "あっ、す、すみません！\n私ったらはしゃいでしまって、はしたない……。", "zh": "啊，不、不好意思！\n我一不小心就兴奋过头了，真是有失体统……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "9665c68925cda341ed7f5dd63b4c3a4d34427ea238bc7f97bc59b2ab0a87d025", "ja": "はは、少しくらいいいじゃないか。\nそれくらい、頑張ったってことだよ。", "zh": "哈哈，稍微兴奋一下也没关系嘛。那也说明你一直很努力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "6197202f4749ec071fca0562c649126b9115ae841919f14cb7ade11f9622c5a9", "ja": "は、はい……美希さんにほめていただけて、\nなんだかほっとしました。", "zh": "是、是的……能得到美希的夸奖，我不知怎么地就放心下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1028_003mik", "source_sha256": "9aaa68cfe9bc805074af729a213c2f9916c356e980a412df465e4a3716265cac", "ja": "ミキじゃなくて、アマリリスがいいって\n言ったんだと思うな。ね、{$P$}！", "zh": "我想，你说的是朱顶红更好，而不是美希吧。对吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "ffedee38ca05b3cd24fe172c55f19981e932f5c107598935af8a8278ecf5fab3", "ja": "うん……そうだな。きっとアマリリスも、\n喜んでると思うよ。自分の心が通じたって。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。我想，アマリリス肯定也很高兴吧。自己的心意终于传达到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "3d55805d2a3b7abc3497a2008ed15e8b3d2ecc9172ac4fcc8d2e3734f8d623fb", "ja": "アマリリスが……。", "zh": "小飞燕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1031_003mik", "source_sha256": "9134ba89c1758f1706e1d7df6e0aad5a19a8205eb21e1d12a1b25b9744c77103", "ja": "それよりエミリー、おやつがあるんでしょ？　千早さん\nから、おやつにクッキー持ってきてるって聞いたよ？", "zh": "比起那个，艾米莉，你带了点心对吧？我听千早说，你带了曲奇来当点心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1032_003mik", "source_sha256": "d2c86331bd6b2c6511d34f7ab98e13c7cea7f223c91eefbd0be885c0d1b08dbf", "ja": "千早さんも味見したけど、おいしかったって。\nみんなで一緒に食べるんでしょ？", "zh": "千早也尝过，说很好吃。\n要和大家一起吃吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1033_032emi", "source_sha256": "62f501d77bca4657c364ad94ec546ff3903ebaf372b04e730158d110e5bb3873", "ja": "あ……は、はいっ！　たくさん持ってきたので、\n召し上がってください！　仕掛け人さまも！", "zh": "啊……是、是的！我带来了很多，\n请尽情享用！制作人先生也请！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1034_002chi", "source_sha256": "df8354295faf38d71b3effe2baa36900b7c9e00f2eb1574436c616e84c7875ee", "ja": "私たち、先輩なのに\nなんだかご馳走になってばかりね。", "zh": "我们明明是前辈，\n却总是在蹭吃蹭喝呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_06_1035_001har", "source_sha256": "4b16d44fb861450fb89b53c276c7d2ff5447c0b6a1abcd3b783e6119c99dbd98", "ja": "あはっ、本当だね！\n私もなにか、お返しを考えないと……。", "zh": "啊哈，说得也是呢！\n我也得想想该回送些什么才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
